'''D'artanyan''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] introduced in [[Version 6.7 Update|Version 6.7]] and can be obtained via rolling the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] during the [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] or [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)|SUPERFEST]] events. Just like most UBERFEST exclusives, D'artanyan serves different roles depending on what form he is taking on. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] into the [[Cat Guide]] but was unobtainable. As of the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.7 Update|March 15, 2024 Update Patch]], he was officially obtainable in the [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|SUPERFEST]] banner.

