==Trivia==
*D'artanyan's name is based off the captain of the Musketeers of the Guard, [[wikipedia:Charles de Batz de Castelmore|D'artagnan]], also known as the Fourth Musketeer.
*Meow-sketeer closely resembles [[wikipedia:Puss in Boots|Puss in Boots]].
*The fact that Meow-sketeer is holding a gun with his tail is probably a joke about the Musket part of Musketeers. A musket is a type of gun used around the time of the setting of the 3 Musketeers, hence the name (his gun does not resemble a musket, instead it resembles a flintlock).
*The three little cats could very well represent the three musketeers in the story while D'artanyan represents D'artagnan. The three cats also carry him in the first form while he carries them in the second form. This represents their motto of all for one and one for all.
*Prior to [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], D'artanyan's English descriptions did not mention his Massive damage ability, instead stating he did "Extra damage to any traited enemy".

